{"id":"n41124-2-7","stage":4,"title":"내지 · 或","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41124-2-7-1","ko":"바쁜 건 언제쯤 끝나?","zh":"你手头忙的事情大概什么时候能结束？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바쁜","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바쁜","audio":"/audio/44dbdc21bbdbc683958f.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"언제쯤","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：疑问词“什么时候”；结合本句询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제쯤","audio":"/audio/fd28178a926508f14a43.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나?","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나","audio":"/audio/e62f8593c85c6b2ece03.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860"